{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1859477185497255", "organization": {"id": "1050551576389824", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1859477185497255"}]}, "id": "1910936153201574"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "1859477185497255", "release_date": 1793116800, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1888618045916502"}, "id": "2588151591687704"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1859477185497255", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1888618045916502"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "1891869895591317", "version": "0.1.5-ea", "version_code": 113, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1794646445, "id": "1891861868925453", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v8", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 7, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "1886903592754614"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "1859477185497255"}, "id": "1886903592754614", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "PENDING", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": null, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654956704_1413176290974716_1551074545287779193_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FvBhUJDLb1oQ7kNvwEH_Cqm&_nc_oc=AdqYNTfI2NMCFahSPm9nkW92oBi2l_gwBxI4inMExHdbWCFSaHou2kXjQJvBiqOR2TI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTR4JAMTfumcyOE5ulDrPlmkljwAo2fiMRKKHPi2EIJ6w&oe=6B0322A5"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "PADEL 01", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Sports", "id": "2776542286000603"}, {"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}], "release_date": 1793116800, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1859477198830587", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1859477185497255", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "2050012628978031"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2122319538377249", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PADEL 01", "keywords": [], "long_description": "PADEL 01 trae el p\u00e1del a Meta Quest. La pista aparece en tu habitaci\u00f3n al tama\u00f1o que cabe en tu espacio, y cada golpe sigue la f\u00edsica del p\u00e1del: efectos, botes y rebotes en el cristal de fondo y lateral.\n\nQU\u00c9 PUEDES JUGAR YA\n- Partidos individuales y de dobles contra bots, de nivel Gentle a Pro\n- Peloteo libre para calentar y practicar a tu ritmo\n- Ejercicios de pared de fondo, pared lateral, globo, volea, bandeja, v\u00edbora, remate, saque, reflejos y m\u00e1s, con estrellas y r\u00e9cords\n- Rankings online opcionales del reto mensual de ejercicios y de la liga contra bots\n- Tres formas de pala con sensaciones propias: redonda para control, l\u00e1grima equilibrada y diamante para potencia\n- Pista en passthrough, portal o inmersi\u00f3n total\n\nACCESO ANTICIPADO\nPADEL 01 es gratis y est\u00e1 en acceso anticipado. Esta versi\u00f3n no incluye multijugador online, avatares, tienda ni compras dentro de la app. Lo pr\u00f3ximo: el club PADEL 01 con partidos online, torneos, avatares y cosm\u00e9ticos. Nada de lo que se compre dar\u00e1 ventaja en el juego.\n\nLos rankings, la copia de progreso en la nube y los diagn\u00f3sticos de prueba son opcionales y se activan o desactivan en los ajustes de privacidad.\n\n\u00danete a la comunidad y cu\u00e9ntanos qu\u00e9 mejorar: https://discord.gg/h44S3ZS3yn\n\nJuega en un espacio despejado de al menos 2 x 2 m y con el l\u00edmite de seguridad del visor activado.", "short_description": "P\u00e1del real en realidad mixta. Tu habitaci\u00f3n se convierte en una pista: juega individuales y dobles contra bots, usa el cristal de fondo y lateral, y entrena voleas, bandejas y remates con tres palas que se sienten distintas."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover_portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "1847437599625484", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831964_1847437602958817_1932268585465311854_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S_hxlj_XFi8Q7kNvwH3_aHF&_nc_oc=AdpdtXgO3ko7e0aBcveVnjrJbUG528L_9_zhq10JAASWX1a7BMT0V2pfu0jovEC_Oy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQXZrwcfTmjJAp1z-SR37T68qkr55RLoDRRsjN6MyXQQ&oe=6B033677"}, {"file_name": "icono_padel_encima_01_512.png", "id": "1615103232778838", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1615103236112171_833100873922920005_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yu53w3rg-wsQ7kNvwH4J3rk&_nc_oc=AdqwN8LQQCraEYGqN6vaPZXbwqeNEX_bCk6rPzR-_E55DGN_2tbESB-rbkDbg8-A3LM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTu_LdUZCITb-_X-Yk6t6pGsTg2Tj22SImeZHZhpSKuIg&oe=6B030609"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "1442581991333530", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDS